Failure found and fixed during P2-7
  The first generic-plan prototype preserved external Params in the Plan, but
  final_topk evaluation passed a NULL ExprContext to ExecEvalExpr.  Generic
  execution therefore blocked before producing a row.  The executor now uses
  the owning PlanState ExprContext, and validates options during ExecutorStart
  so an outer LIMIT 0 cannot bypass the positive-K contract.
